# Vitality Base runs with NO environment variables. Fork, deploy, done.
#
# OPTIONAL — live-data keys. Each user adds their OWN free key — NEVER share one
# (a shared key hits its quota and gets revoked for everyone at once). Set
# these in .env.local for local dev and in Netlify → Environment Variables when
# live; they stay server-side and never reach the browser. Without them, stock
# tiles just show "add a key" and manual entry still works.
#   Stock prices → https://finnhub.io → free signup → copy API key
FINNHUB_API_KEY=
